course: dictionary
lesson: 5322
title: Keratin: the tough stuff in hair and nails
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Keratin is a tough protein. A protein is a substance found in living things, and keratin is the part that makes things hard and strong.
explain: Your hair, fingernails, claws, horns, hooves, feathers and the outer layer of your skin are all made of keratin. «Rhino horns are made of keratin, the same stuff as hair and fingernails.» So a rhino's horn and your nails are made of the same tough material.
explain: This explains why cutting hair and nails does not hurt. The part you cut is made of dead keratin, so it does not feel pain. Only the root under your skin is alive.
fact: Keratin is a tough protein.
fact: Hair, nails, claws, horns, hooves, feathers and the outer layer of skin are made of keratin.
fact: «Baleen is made of keratin, the same stuff as our fingernails.»
fact: The hair you see is dead keratin; only the root under the skin is alive.
fact: Useful phrases: made of keratin, keratin protein.
exercise: What is keratin? | A soft, watery liquid | *A tough protein | A type of green plant | A kind of bone
exercise: «Rhino horns are made of keratin, the same stuff as hair and fingernails.» Which two things is keratin the same stuff as? | Grass and leaves | Water and air | *Hair and nails | Bone and teeth
exercise: Why does cutting your hair not hurt? | *The part you cut is dead keratin | Hair is full of blood | Hair is made of water | Hair is soft like jelly
test: «Baleen is made of keratin, the same stuff as our fingernails.» What is baleen made of? | Salt | Glass | Sugar | *Keratin
test: «Shaving does not make hair grow back thicker.» Which part of the hair is alive? | *Only the root under the skin | The tip you can see | The nail | The whole hair
exam: «Rhino horn is made of keratin, the same stuff as hair and fingernails; it is no medicine.» So what is rhino horn? | Medicine that cures every illness | *Keratin, the same tough stuff as hair and nails | Bone from a rhino's leg | Glass that shines in the sun
